{"text":"I cannot go to Munnan meetings, I cannot have a say because I am female. Culture does not make people, people make culture. So if it is in fact true, so if it is in fact true that the full humanity of women is not our culture, then we must make it our culture. I think, I think very often of my dear friend, Ocoloma Madwewesu, May he, and all the others who passed away in that so-so lisa crash continue to rest in peace. He will always be remembered by those of us who loved him. And he was right that day many years ago when he called me a feminist. I am a feminist. And when I looked up the word in the dictionary that day, this is what it said. Feminist, a person who believes in the social, political and economic equality of the sexes. My great grandmother from the stories I've heard was a feminist. She ran away from the house of the man she did not want to marry and ended up marrying the man of her choice.","words":[{"text":"I","start":0.0,"end":0.68},{"text":"cannot","start":0.68,"end":0.86},{"text":"go","start":0.86,"end":1.08},{"text":"to","start":1.08,"end":1.24},{"text":"Munnan","start":1.24,"end":1.56},{"text":"meetings","start":1.56,"end":1.94,"punct":","},{"text":"I","start":2.62,"end":2.7},{"text":"cannot","start":2.7,"end":2.88},{"text":"have","start":2.88,"end":3.12},{"text":"a","start":3.12,"end":3.28},{"text":"say","start":3.28,"end":3.54},{"text":"because","start":3.54,"end":4.52},{"text":"I","start":4.52,"end":4.7},{"text":"am","start":4.7,"end":4.78},{"text":"female","start":4.78,"end":5.2,"punct":"."},{"text":"Culture","start":6.72,"end":6.72},{"text":"does","start":6.72,"end":7.0},{"text":"not","start":7.0,"end":7.18},{"text":"make","start":7.18,"end":7.46},{"text":"people","start":7.46,"end":7.98,"punct":","},{"text":"people","start":8.46,"end":8.76},{"text":"make","start":8.76,"end":9.12},{"text":"culture","start":9.12,"end":9.66,"punct":"."},{"text":"So","start":11.4,"end":11.48},{"text":"if","start":11.48,"end":11.66},{"text":"it","start"